---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="How to Get to Milos, Greece"
  description="The complete guide to reaching Milos — ferry from Piraeus, flights from Athens, tips for booking tickets and getting around the island."
>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="guide-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="page-label">Travel guide</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">How to Get to Milos</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">
      Milos is one of the most spectacular destinations in the Aegean —
      but getting there takes a little planning. This guide tells you exactly
      how to arrive, when to book, and what to avoid.
    </p>
    <div class="guide-meta">
      <span>🕐 5 min read</span>
      <span>✍️ Milos.guide</span>
      <span>📅 Updated 2025</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CONTENT -->
<article class="guide-article sec sec-sand">
  <div class="container guide-layout">

    <div class="guide-body">

      <!-- INTRO -->
      <section class="guide-section">
        <p class="guide-lead">
          Milos has no bridge, no tunnel, no road connection to the mainland.
          That's exactly what keeps it authentic. But it also means a bit of preparation
          is needed — especially if you're travelling in July or August, when tickets
          sell out weeks in advance.
        </p>
        <p>
          Two options: <strong>ferry</strong> from Piraeus (the most popular) or
          <strong>flight</strong> from Athens (faster, but fewer connections).
          Let's look at both in detail.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- FERRY -->
      <section class="guide-section" id="ferry">
        <h2>🚢 By ferry — The most popular option</h2>

        <p>
          The ferry from <strong>Piraeus</strong> is the classic way to reach Milos.
          Daily sailings throughout summer, and several per week in winter.
        </p>

        <h3>How long does it take?</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Regular ferry</strong> — ~7 hours. Ideal if you travel overnight so you don't lose a day.</li>
          <li><strong>High-speed ferry</strong> — ~3.5 hours. SeaJets and Hellenic Seaways. More expensive, but saves time.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Which companies?</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>ANEK Lines</strong> — overnight sailings, good prices</li>
          <li><strong>SeaJets</strong> — high-speed, mainly in summer</li>
          <li><strong>Golden Star Ferries</strong> — daytime sailings</li>
          <li><strong>Hellenic Seaways</strong> — high-speed from Piraeus</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Can I arrive from other islands?</h3>
        <p>
          Yes — Milos is connected to <strong>Santorini, Sifnos, Serifos, Kimolos</strong>
          and other Cycladic islands. If you're island hopping, it fits perfectly into the route.
        </p>

        <!-- FERRYHOPPER PLACEHOLDER -->
        <div class="widget-placeholder">
          <div class="wp-icon">⚓</div>
          <div>
            <p class="wp-title">Check schedules & book your ticket</p>
            <p class="wp-sub">Compare companies, times and prices in real time</p>
          </div>
          <!-- FERRYHOPPER WIDGET / AFFILIATE LINK HERE -->
          <a href="https://www.ferryhopper.com/?utm_source=milos.guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="wp-btn">
            Search ferries ↗
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="insider-tip">
          <span class="tip-icon">💡</span>
          <p><strong>Insider tip:</strong> The overnight ferry (departure ~21:00 from Piraeus, arrival ~04:00 in Milos) is the favourite choice of locals — you sleep on board and wake up in Milos. You save a full day of travel.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FLIGHT -->
      <section class="guide-section" id="flight">
        <h2>✈️ By plane — The fast option</h2>

        <p>
          Milos Airport (code <strong>MLO</strong>) is 4 kilometres from Adamas.
          Small, relaxed, no queues — but with <strong>fewer connections</strong>
          than you might expect.
        </p>

        <h3>From Athens</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Flight duration: <strong>~40 minutes</strong></li>
          <li>Airline: <strong>Sky Express</strong> (mainly) — daily flights in summer</li>
          <li>Prices: from ~€60 if booked early, but they rise quickly</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Charter flights</h3>
        <p>
          In summer there are direct charter flights from European cities
          (London, Zurich, Amsterdam). Check on Skyscanner or with your tour operator.
        </p>

        <!-- SKYSCANNER PLACEHOLDER -->
        <div class="widget-placeholder">
          <div class="wp-icon">✈️</div>
          <div>
            <p class="wp-title">Compare flight prices</p>
            <p class="wp-sub">Find the best fares for flights to Milos (MLO)</p>
          </div>
          <!-- SKYSCANNER WIDGET / AFFILIATE LINK HERE -->
          <a href="https://www.skyscanner.com/flights-to/mlo/cheap-flights-to-milos-island-national-airport.html?utm_source=milos.guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="wp-btn">
            Search flights ↗
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="insider-tip">
          <span class="tip-icon">💡</span>
          <p><strong>Insider tip:</strong> Flights to Milos sell out very fast in July and August. If you're travelling in peak season, book <strong>2–3 months in advance</strong>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- GETTING AROUND -->
      <section class="guide-section" id="getting-around">
        <h2>🚗 Getting around the island</h2>

        <p>
          Once you arrive, you'll need a way to explore. The local bus (KTEL) covers
          the main routes, but for beaches like Sarakiniko or Tsigrado
          you'll need your own vehicle.
        </p>

        <div class="transport-grid">
          <div class="transport-item">
            <span class="transport-icon">🚗</span>
            <div>
              <p class="transport-title">Car rental</p>
              <p class="transport-desc">The best option. Many agencies in Adamas and at the airport. Book ahead in August.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="transport-item">
            <span class="transport-icon">🛵</span>
            <div>
              <p class="transport-title">Scooter / ATV</p>
              <p class="transport-desc">Ideal for couples. Be careful on unpaved roads — some beaches have tricky access.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="transport-item">
            <span class="transport-icon">🚌</span>
            <div>
              <p class="transport-title">Local bus (KTEL)</p>
              <p class="transport-desc">Covers Adamas, Plaka, Tripiti, Pollonia. Doesn't reach most beaches.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="transport-item">
            <span class="transport-icon">⛵</span>
            <div>
              <p class="transport-title">Boat tours</p>
              <p class="transport-desc">For beaches like Kleftiko and Sykia Cave, a boat is the only option. Departures in the morning from Adamas.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- TIPS -->
      <section class="guide-section" id="tips">
        <h2>📋 Tips so you don't miss your connection</h2>

        <div class="tips-list">
          <div class="tip-item">
            <span class="tip-num">01</span>
            <div>
              <p class="tip-title">Book tickets early — especially July–August</p>
              <p class="tip-body">High-speed ferries sell out 2–3 weeks in advance. Regular ferries last longer, but they fill up too.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tip-item">
            <span class="tip-num">02</span>
            <div>
              <p class="tip-title">Check for meltemi winds before taking a high-speed ferry</p>
              <p class="tip-body">Strong northerly winds cause cancellations on fast ferries. If you have a tight schedule, choose a regular ferry or a flight.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tip-item">
            <span class="tip-num">03</span>
            <div>
              <p class="tip-title">Board the ferry 30 minutes before departure</p>
              <p class="tip-body">Especially if you have a car. Vehicle boarding happens first and the ramp closes early.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tip-item">
            <span class="tip-num">04</span>
            <div>
              <p class="tip-title">Do online check-in for your flight</p>
              <p class="tip-body">MLO airport is small — but at peak summer it can get chaotic without pre-check-in.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tip-item">
            <span class="tip-num">05</span>
            <div>
              <p class="tip-title">Have a backup plan for cancellations</p>
              <p class="tip-body">Weather cancellations are not rare. Keep the ferry company's number handy and check the status in the morning.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section class="guide-cta">
        <div class="cta-inner">
          <h2>Don't leave it to the last minute</h2>
          <p>
            Milos is one of the most popular islands in the Cyclades — and ticket availability
            proves it. Book online, skip the port queues
            and start your holiday relaxed.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-btns">
            <a href="https://www.ferryhopper.com/?utm_source=milos.guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="btn-dark">🚢 Ferry tickets</a>
            <a href="https://www.skyscanner.com/flights-to/mlo/cheap-flights-to-milos-island-national-airport.html?utm_source=milos.guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="btn-outline">✈️ Flight tickets</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- SIDEBAR TOC -->
    <aside class="guide-toc">
      <div class="toc-card">
        <p class="toc-label">Contents</p>
        <a href="#ferry">🚢 By ferry</a>
        <a href="#flight">✈️ By plane</a>
        <a href="#getting-around">🚗 Getting around</a>
        <a href="#tips">📋 Tips</a>
      </div>
      <div class="toc-card">
        <p class="toc-label">Useful links</p>
        <a href="https://www.ferryhopper.com/?utm_source=milos.guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="toc-link-btn">⚓ Ferry tickets</a>
        <a href="https://www.skyscanner.com/flights-to/mlo/cheap-flights-to-milos-island-national-airport.html?utm_source=milos.guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="toc-link-btn">✈️ Flights to MLO</a>
      </div>
      <div class="toc-card">
        <p class="toc-label">Explore</p>
        <a href="/beaches">🏖 Beaches</a>
        <a href="/sights">🏛 Sights</a>
        <a href="/map">🗺 Island map</a>
        <a href="/weather">🌤 Weather</a>
      </div>
    </aside>

  </div>
</article>

</Layout>

<style>
/* ── HERO ── */
.guide-hero {
  background: var(--white);
  padding: 3rem 0 2.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.page-label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--sea);
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}
.page-title {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
  color: var(--deep-blue);
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.page-desc {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 640px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.guide-meta {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--muted);
}

/* ── LAYOUT ── */
.guide-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 260px;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: start;
  padding-top: 3rem;
  padding-bottom: 5rem;
}

/* ── BODY ── */
.guide-lead {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.82;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  font-style: italic;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sea);
  padding-left: 1.25rem;
}

.guide-section {
  padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.guide-section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

.guide-section h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  color: var(--deep-blue);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  margin-top: 0;
  scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1rem);
}
.guide-section h3 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
}
.guide-section p {
  font-size: 0.975rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
}
.guide-section ul {
  margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
}
.guide-section ul li {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--ink);
}

/* Widget placeholder */
.widget-placeholder {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  margin: 1.5rem 0;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.wp-icon { font-size: 2rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.wp-title { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
.wp-sub { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); }
.wp-btn {
  margin-left: auto;
  padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
  background: var(--deep-blue);
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  white-space: nowrap;
  transition: background 0.15s;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.wp-btn:hover { background: var(--aegean); }

/* Insider tip */
.insider-tip {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.85rem;
  background: rgba(58,155,201,0.07);
  border: 1px solid rgba(58,155,201,0.2);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  margin: 1rem 0;
}
.tip-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
.insider-tip p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

/* Transport grid */
.transport-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-top: 1.25rem;
}
.transport-item {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.85rem;
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 1.1rem;
}
.transport-icon { font-size: 1.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.transport-title { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
.transport-desc { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }

/* Tips list */
.tips-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; margin-top: 1rem; }
.tip-item {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.25rem;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--white);
}
.tip-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.tip-item:nth-child(even) { background: var(--sand); }
.tip-num {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  color: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.tip-title { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
.tip-body { font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }

/* CTA */
.guide-cta {
  margin-top: 1rem;
}
.cta-inner {
  background: var(--deep-blue);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 2.5rem;
  color: #fff;
}
.cta-inner h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.cta-inner p {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  line-height: 1.75;
  max-width: 520px;
  margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
}
.cta-btns { display: flex; gap: 0.85rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.btn-outline {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.45rem;
  padding: 0.78rem 1.55rem;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  background: transparent;
  color: #fff;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
}
.btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }

/* ── SIDEBAR ── */
.guide-toc {
  position: sticky;
  top: calc(var(--header-h) + 1.5rem);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1rem;
}
.toc-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 1.25rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.1rem;
}
.toc-label {
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
}
.toc-card a {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  padding: 0.3rem 0;
  border-left: 2px solid transparent;
  padding-left: 0.65rem;
  transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, padding-left 0.15s;
}
.toc-card a:hover { color: var(--aegean); border-color: var(--aegean); padding-left: 0.85rem; }
.toc-link-btn {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.25rem;
  padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem !important;
  background: var(--sand);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  border-left: none !important;
  font-size: 0.82rem !important;
  color: var(--ink) !important;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.toc-link-btn:hover { background: var(--sand-dark) !important; color: var(--ink) !important; padding-left: 0.85rem !important; }

/* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .transport-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .guide-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .guide-toc { position: static; }
  .widget-placeholder { flex-direction: column; }
  .wp-btn { margin-left: 0; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
  .cta-btns { flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>
